    "recommendations": "Confirming address numbers are clearly visible from the street and at the driveway entrance could significantly improve response times given the single access point and extended driveway length. Ensuring the driveway and unpaved circulation route remain clear of obstructions wide enough to accommodate emergency apparatus would support effective access and turnaround capability. Where vegetation overhangs the driveway corridor, maintaining adequate vertical clearance could facilitate unimpeded apparatus travel. Identifying and communicating an alternate staging area within the open terrain to responding units may assist operations should the primary access point become blocked during an incident."
